#: applications/luci-app-shunt/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/shunt/overview.js:508
msgid ""
"Most addresses one learned Set holds, per policy and address family. An "
"address beyond it is not learned until older ones expire and takes the "
"normal uplink meanwhile. It bounds what a host on an observed segment can do "
"with forged DNS answers; raise it only if a policy with a very large list "
"reaches it."
msgstr ""
"根据策略和地址族，每个“已学习地址集”（Learned Set）所能容纳的地址数量是有上限"
"的。若地址数量超出此上限，新地址将无法被学习，直到旧地址过期；在此期间，相关"
"流量将通过正常的上行链路进行转发。该限制旨在约束网段内的主机利用伪造 DNS 响应"
"进行恶意操作的能力；仅当包含大量条目的策略触及此上限时，才应考虑调高该限制"
"值。"

